   "fontFamily": 2,
   "fontSize": 17,
   "text": "The wallet audit trail: every change to one customer’s wallet, read-only, built from the wireframe kit.\nIt opens on the customer in the link (/wallet?userId=…, from “Wallet history”), otherwise the one you are acting as.\nSample text is real data (User-356958d2) from the seeded database. Dates are Indian calendar days; both ends are included.",
   "originalText": "The wallet audit trail: every change to one customer’s wallet, read-only, built from the wireframe kit.\nIt opens on the customer in the link (/wallet?userId=…, from “Wallet history”), otherwise the one you are acting as.\nSample text is real data (User-356958d2) from the seeded database. Dates are Indian calendar days; both ends are included.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
